  "uprn": "200003976940",
  "decision_date": "03/06/2004",
  "description": "ERECTION OF A TWO-STOREY EXTENSION AT FIRST FLOOR SERVICE AREA LEVEL TO REAR OF EXISTING CAF? TO CREATE LARGE RETAIL UNIT ON FIRST FLOOR OF TREATY CENTRE AND RELOCATION OF MANAGEMENT SUITE, RELOCATION OF CCTV PORTAKABIN, RELOCATION OF COMPACTORS AND AIR-CONDITIONING UNITS",
  "site_name": "Treaty Centre",
  "last_updated_by": "Northgate M3",
  "decision_target_date": "08/01/2004",
  "borough": "Hounslow",
  "postcode": null,
  "street_name": null,
  "bo_system": "Northgate M3",
  "development_type": "Major general industry-storage-warehousing",
  "lapsed_date": "02/06/2009",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - It is considered that the proposed erection of a two-storey extension at first floor level within the existing central loading and servicing area of the Treaty Centre, and the creation of a large retail unit with store room above, because of its design, position and appearance, would be acceptable having due regard for the site characteristics of the Treaty Centre and would not result in any loss of amenity to the area. The proposal would accord with the Council's Maximum Parking Standards, and would not be detrimental to servicing and loading operations at the Treaty Centre or prejudicial to local highway conditions. On balance, the development is in accordance with Unitary Development Plan (December 2003) policies IMP.2.2, ENV-B.1.1, ENV-B.1.9, S.3.1, T.1.4 and T.2.1.",
    "Condition : 2 - The development hereby permitted shall be begun before the expiration of five years from the date of this permission.",
    "Condition : 3 - No development shall take place until samples of the materials to be used in the construction of the external surfaces of the hereby permitted have been submitted to and approved in writing by the local planning authority.  Development shall be carried out in accordance with the approved details",
    "Condition : 4 - The proposed development shall be carried out in all respects in accordance with the proposals contained in the application and the plans submitted therewith and approved by the Local Planning Authority, or as shall have been otherwise agreed in writing by the Local Planning Authority before the extension is used.",
    "Condition : 5 - No development shall take place until there has been submitted to and approved in writing by the Local Planning Authority, details of speed reduction measures and coloured demarcation paths for pedestrians and vehicles, adjacent to the pedestrian entrance to the Treaty Centre. Such provisions shall pay particular attention to the needs of people with a mobility handicap.",
    "Condition : 6 - No development shall take place until there has been submitted to and approved in writing by the Local Planning Authority, details of the agreed relocation of the existing Hounslow Town Centre CCTV temporary office accommodation on-site. The CCTV accommodation shall operational and relocated on-site within the Treaty Centre in accordance with any approval given, prior to the commencement of the works hereby permitted."
  ],
